# Tuning, reduced to the part that cannot plausibly affect boot.
#
# This is the same idea as configs/tuning.fragment, minus KASAN. It exists for
# exactly one situation: "the tuned build does not boot, and KASAN is the
# suspect". Building this says whether the sanitizer removal was the cause
# without giving up the debug-symbol removal, which has no runtime effect at all.
#
# Selected with TUNING=nodebug, never used by configs/tuning.fragment.

# CONFIG_DEBUG_INFO is not set
# CONFIG_GDB_SCRIPTS is not set
# CONFIG_DEBUG_EFI is not set
